@startuml
title D-01 Operator Console Context Diagram

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor "Site Operator" as Operator
actor "Site Supervisor" as Supervisor
actor "Compliance Auditor" as Auditor
actor "Support / Technical Ops" as Support

component "Operator Console\ninternal non-payment governance console" as Console
component "Central PMS\ncontrol state + finality + ExitAuthorization" as Central
component "Central PMS /\nDiscount workflow" as Discount
component "Vendor PMS / HCP\nnormal session + tariff authority" as Vendor
component "Integration Health /\nProjection Freshness" as Health
component "Assisted Payment Terminal\npayment-capable terminal app" as APT
component "ExitPass Continuity\ncontrolled degraded operations" as Continuity
component "Resolved Site POS Server\nfiscal issuer" as POS
component "Gate / Exit System\nCentral PMS authorization consumer" as Gate

Operator --> Console : lookup / review / evidence
Supervisor --> Console : approval / override / continuity review
Auditor --> Console : audit / evidence / reports
Support --> Console : device / health support

Console --> Central : approved backend flow
Console --> Discount : statutory review context
Console --> Health : connector and projection visibility
Console --> Continuity : activation / review governance
Console --> APT : review terminal actions
Central --> Vendor : live normal authority
Central --> POS : fiscal issuance request
Central --> Gate : ExitAuthorization

note right of Console
No payment collection.
No payment finality.
No Sales Invoice issuance.
No ExitAuthorization issuance.
No direct gate opening.
end note

@enduml
